{"nusach":"chabad","id":"mezuzah","sections":[{"title":{"he":"קביעת מזוזה","en":"Affixing a Mezuzah"},"segments":[{"key":"1jg7v1rkxr","he":[[{"t":"הקובע מזוזה מברך:","s":"n"}]]},{"key":"vn4tZyBeGt","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" אַתָּה יְיָ אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, אֲשֶׁר קִדְּשָׁנוּ בְּמִצְוֹתָיו, וְצִוָּנוּ לִקְבּֽוֹעַ מְזוּזָה:"}]]}]}],"credits":[{"title":"Weekday Siddur Chabad — Wikisource","license":"CC-BY-SA","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Weekday_Siddur_Chabad"}]}